+expect=stderr:contains=ddos-flowspec: a previous run left a FlowSpec rule announced, withdrawing it
+expect=stderr:contains=ddos-flowspec: the withdrawal of a FlowSpec rule a previous run announced failed, so the rule may still be at the BGP peers and stays recorded
+
+cmd=foreground:seq=7:exec=le test fixture daemon/await-answer doctor-ddos-flowspec-orphan-announcement "show doctor | json":exit=0
